Or as I'm falling asleep, you know,

00:39:28.120 --> 00:39:29.740
do something that's gonna wake me up

00:39:29.740 --> 00:39:34.277
and just have an intention of
trying to solve these things.

00:39:34.277 --> 00:39:35.520
- Well, you know what's interesting?

00:39:35.520 --> 00:39:36.353
- Solve the problem.

00:39:36.353 --> 00:39:37.690
- Now that we're talking about this,

00:39:37.690 --> 00:39:40.720
I do, it has hit me

00:39:40.720 --> 00:39:45.720
that while in the sauna at
