I mean, I've had ideas while walking

00:40:39.193 --> 00:40:40.271
and sometimes you're like,

00:40:40.271 --> 00:40:41.900
"I need to, let me take a walk on this."

00:40:41.900 --> 00:40:44.550
Well, I don't know the science behind it,

00:40:44.550 --> 00:40:48.027
but the idea that you're in motion,

00:40:48.027 --> 00:40:50.900
you kind of get your body and your mind

00:40:50.900 --> 00:40:54.510
kind of doing something, and
then something cracks open.

00:40:54.510 --> 00:40:56.473
- Well, I mean, my theory is,

00:40:57.320 --> 00:40:59.540
yeah, I like to do a lot of thinking

00:40:59.540 --> 00:41:03.130
when I'm like riding my mountain bike.

00:41:03.130 --> 00:41:05.900
I've started doing that more
often, just kind of taking,

