00:41:41.420 --> 00:41:43.730
You know, it's, it ruminates.

00:41:43.730 --> 00:41:47.300
And I think, you know,
when you're in your body,

00:41:47.300 --> 00:41:51.020
I do think that you think differently.

00:41:51.020 --> 00:41:51.853
- Oh, yeah.

00:41:51.853 --> 00:41:55.420
- And so you can approach
problems differently,

00:41:55.420 --> 00:41:58.170
or a creative exercise differently.

00:41:58.170 --> 00:42:01.800
So it, but, 'cause for me, a lot of times,

00:42:01.800 --> 00:42:04.150
I've noticed, you know,

00:42:04.150 --> 00:42:05.820
you get so much in your head about,

00:42:05.820 --> 00:42:07.040
well, I need to accomplish this,

00:42:07.040 --> 00:42:08.430
or I gotta solve this problem,

00:42:08.430 --> 00:42:11.160
or I really want to create
