00:42:33.140 --> 00:42:36.719
So I can kind of play with the idea.

00:42:36.719 --> 00:42:38.440
It's the difference between
working with an idea

00:42:38.440 --> 00:42:40.170
and playing with an idea.

00:42:40.170 --> 00:42:43.720
And so I don't know any of
the science really behind it,

00:42:43.720 --> 00:42:47.430
but I've observed

00:42:47.430 --> 00:42:48.263
that

00:42:50.560 --> 00:42:53.000
the best solutions or ideas

00:42:53.000 --> 00:42:55.530
come from left field when
you when you least expect it,

00:42:55.530 --> 00:42:58.120
or when you give room
and remove the pressure

00:42:58.120 --> 00:43:00.920
of having to show improve.

00:43:00.920 --> 00:43:04.163
- I kind of experienced
it as a balance between,

00:43:07.650 --> 00:43:09.752
like if I sit down, and I'm like,

00:43:09.752 --> 00:43:12.153
okay, I need to write this thing.

00:43:13.060 --> 00:43:16.590
And like, okay, this, you know,

00:43:16.590 --> 00:43:18.973
