01:03:21.266 --> 01:03:22.400
okay, well, I've got to get up.

01:03:22.400 --> 01:03:24.680
I've got to have at least
20 minutes to sit there

01:03:24.680 --> 01:03:26.426
and do these stretches,

01:03:26.426 --> 01:03:28.610
and you can't go faster
than the stretches allow.

01:03:28.610 --> 01:03:30.920
And so I guess that's a good thing.

01:03:30.920 --> 01:03:32.970
Sometimes there's, you know, pain can be,

01:03:34.150 --> 01:03:36.240
an inconvenience can be
a blessing if you turn it

01:03:36.240 --> 01:03:40.053
into something that ends up
being sort of meditative.

